{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都にて全国握手会と個別握手会を行いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足元の悪い中来てくださり本当に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方の手が氷のように冷たい方が沢山いて心配の気持ちと反面嬉しい気持ちと感謝の気持ちでいっぱいになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の外まで列ができていて、五時間待ったよーという声も聞いたりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大変な中遠くの県や海外からも来ていただいてとっても感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しの時間ですが、ちょっとでも心暖まる握手ができるといいなーとか、ハッピーな気持ちで終えてもらえるといいなーと思いながら楽しく握手会させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握ではとってもキュートな笑顔の松村さゆり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんとでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんファンの皆様とっても優しくてまっちゅんみたいな方が多かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか似ていたな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまっちゅん笑いながら休憩の時、まあやずっと問題出されたり、番組のアンクルアンクルって答えてて面白い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たしかに全握ずっとアンクルアンクル言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていつも来てくださる方にも新年明けて会えたのもとても嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントとかでいけないよーって方もいましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもちゃんと！気持ち届いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個別握手会も沢山の方来てくださって本当に嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山色々なお話できたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブや乃木中のはなしそしてゴルフや誕生日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして握手券ないけど遠くから少しでも見ようとわざわざ会場に来てくださったりと、皆さんの思い！ちゃんと届いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中本当に本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握の服は黒で大人っぽく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真後ろのファスナー閉め忘れてるの...気づかずこのまま帰ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"趣味は何？とかはまってることは？\nって聞かれてもいつも困ってたけどやっと決まった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメにはよく送ってるまあやの料理！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野菜とかは全部無農薬、調味料もオーガニックのを使うように心がけてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無農薬野菜は甘くて美味しいから余計はまっちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイク道具やシャンプーリンス身の回りのものをオーガニックで揃えるのはな大ハマりしてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またベランダとかでお野菜育てようかなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔はすーぐ枯らしてたけど。今ならできる気がする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしこれがまあやのマイブーム！ハマってることや趣味にする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいかわいい愛犬❤\n右上はカットに連れて言ってあげれなくてモフモフになりすぎた時の写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左上は寂しい時に自分の腕をくわえてガジガジしちゃうの(  ･᷄-･᷅ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左下は安定の場所"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもひっつきもっつきでくっついてくるのが本当に可愛くて可愛くて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛おしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイニープードルだからちっちゃくてかわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空き時間、ひなちま、まあや、ろってぃー、ちーちゃんで絵しりとりとかして遊んだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画力が訳ありなので一部だけ載せる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとちま絵がへたっぴなのよ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右上はちーちゃんが書いた似顔絵"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左はろってぃーの書いた似顔絵！2人とも上手"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして関係ないけど右下の箸が折れてるの！！！！これこの状態で入ってて珍しくて思わず写真撮った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうだけ...苦笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/16/6248746/0020.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}